    {
      "source": "Returns a new Repository based on the metadata. Two categories of repositories can be instantiated:\n<a href=\"SimpleReactiveCouchbaseRepository.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.repository.support\"><code>SimpleReactiveCouchbaseRepository</code></a>. This method performs feature checks to decide which of the two\ncategories can be instantiated (eg. is N1QL available?). Instantiation is done via reflection, see\n<a href=\"#getRepositoryBaseClass(org.springframework.data.repository.core.RepositoryMetadata)\"><code>getRepositoryBaseClass(RepositoryMetadata)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "根据元数据返回一个新的 Repository。可以实例化两类仓库：<a href=\"SimpleReactiveCouchbaseRepository.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.repository.support\"><code>SimpleReactiveCouchbaseRepository</code></a>。此方法执行功能检查以决定可以实例化哪一类（例如，N1QL 是否可用？）。实例化通过反射完成，请参阅 <a href=\"#getRepositoryBaseClass(org.springframework.data.repository.core.RepositoryMetadata)\"><code>getRepositoryBaseClass(RepositoryMetadata)</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the base class for the repository being constructed. Two categories of repositories can be produced by this\nfactory: <a href=\"SimpleReactiveCouchbaseRepository.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.repository.support\"><code>SimpleReactiveCouchbaseRepository</code></a> and. This method checks if N1QL is available to choose between\nthe two, but the actual concrete class is determined respectively by. Override these methods if you want to change\nthe base class for all your repositories.",
      "translation": "返回正在构建的存储库的基础类。此工厂可以生成两类存储库：<a href=\"SimpleReactiveCouchbaseRepository.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.repository.support\"><code>SimpleReactiveCouchbaseRepository</code></a> 和。此方法会检查 N1QL 是否可用，以在这两者之间进行选择，但具体的实际类由分别确定。如果您想更改所有存储库的基础类，请覆盖这些方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
